{
  "id": "6a96bf2e2bcccfd97f28278e",
  "title": "複雑化してて読みづらいUserCSS",
  "created": 1788264239,
  "updated": 1788369379,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e2bcccfd97f28278e",
      "text": "複雑化してて読みづらいUserCSS",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264276
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab63",
      "text": "from [2026/08/31]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf340000000000b2ab87",
      "text": "[Summer498.icon]愚痴：[UserCSS] 複雑化してて読みづらい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264244,
      "updated": 1788264703
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab65",
      "text": "\tCSS はなー、変数を使うと逆に読みづらくなるんよ……。再利用箇所があるなら妥当な変数導入になるけど。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab66",
      "text": "\t\tマジックナンバーも使われてるから無闇に変数化しているわけではなさそう。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab67",
      "text": "\t読みづらポイント",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab68",
      "text": " \t主にパフォーマンス軽減のために丁寧な指定を行っているセレクタ部分",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab69",
      "text": " \t大量の変数",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab6a",
      "text": " これだけだから、どっかに解説ページでも用意しておけばヌルっと読めそう。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab6b",
      "text": " んー、見てるうちに慣れてきた()",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab6c",
      "text": " \t見てるうちに慣れてしまうと逆に初心者への優しさを忘れてしまう",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf670000000000b2ab88",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264296,
      "updated": 1788264296
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9850d600000000000657f2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788367061,
      "updated": 1788367061
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab6d",
      "text": "[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264476
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96c01b0000000000b2ab8e",
      "text": "あー、挙げられた特徴からすると多分、わたしの書いたUserCSSですね。他の方の書いたCosenseのUserCSSは値がハードコーディングされていることが多いため",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264476,
      "updated": 1788264476
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bfec0000000000b2ab8c",
      "text": "　書いた本人は大体把握できているものの、後からコードを読む人からすると煩雑で直感的に[保守]しづらい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264428,
      "updated": 1788264680
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab6e",
      "text": "　具体的にどのUserCSSページを見ているのか教えてくださると助かります",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264312
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf790000000000b2ab89",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264314,
      "updated": 1788264314
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab70",
      "text": "> 読みづらポイント",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264444
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab71",
      "text": "> \t主にパフォーマンス軽減のために丁寧な指定を行っているセレクタ部分",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264444
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab72",
      "text": " 　たぶん特に分かりづらいのはこれ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264603
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab73",
      "text": " 　　[リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS：変更案（2026-07）]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264603
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab74",
      "text": " 　　[/customize/引用文中のインデントを通常の箇条書きにする]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264603
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab75",
      "text": ">  大量の変数",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264444
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab76",
      "text": " 　この辺りだろうか？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264614
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab77",
      "text": " 　　[井戸端の追加のテーマ変数対応]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264614
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab78",
      "text": " 　　[/customize/箇条書きのドットの大きさを可変にする]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264614
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab79",
      "text": " 　　　変数上での calc() を多用した結果重くなってしまったため、作成者自身[Nrem.icon]も最近は無効化している",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788269525
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf800000000000b2ab8a",
      "text": " 　　個人用projectにしか置いていないUserCSSにはこういうのもある",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264320,
      "updated": 1788264614
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bfb80000000000b2ab8b",
      "text": " 　　　[/nrem-configs/Aureolo Light]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264377,
      "updated": 1788264614
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab7a",
      "text": " 　　　[/nrem-configs/.section-title の太字を見出しにするUserCSS]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264614
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96c0b30000000000b2ab90",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264627,
      "updated": 1788264629
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab7c",
      "text": "[CSS変数]を導入する理由[hr.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788368271
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984a5900000000005fda0f",
      "text": "　セレクターを直接指定してオーバーロードするのと、.deco- クラス内で変数の値だけ切り替えるのとを比較して、",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788365401,
      "updated": 1788365401
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984a5900000000005fda10",
      "text": "　　1. どちらのほうがコードが簡潔になるか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788365401,
      "updated": 1788367168
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984a5900000000005fda11",
      "text": "　　2. パフォーマンス負荷が小さく済むか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788365401,
      "updated": 1788367183
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984a6c00000000005fda12",
      "text": "　記法や配色テーマの実装の都合",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788365420,
      "updated": 1788365439
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab7d",
      "text": "　　ダークテーマ対応の都合",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788365441
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab7e",
      "text": "　個人UserCSSでスタイル変更する際の都合",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264569
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab7f",
      "text": "　　[疎結合]じゃないと色々とあれ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788367638
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab80",
      "text": "　値を他のUserCSSから参照したいことがある",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264569
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab81",
      "text": "　　これとか──[/nrem-configs/画面幅に応じてページの表示スケールを変更する]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264569
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab82",
      "text": "　コメントの代わりに変数名で示してしまう",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264569
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984ac000000000005fda13",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788365504,
      "updated": 1788365504
    },
    {
      "id": "6a98510f00000000000657f3",
      "text": " 1. どちらのほうがコードが簡潔になるか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788367119,
      "updated": 1788367161
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984c9900000000000657d6",
      "text": "　具体例：[アイコン記法を画像記法っぽくするUserCSS#6a79a80c000000000000e3f8]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788365977,
      "updated": 1788366018
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984cae00000000000657d8",
      "text": "  > 画像と同じ filter を適用する",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788365998,
      "updated": 1788366053
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984cdc00000000000657e1",
      "text": "  > cf. [ダークテーマに表示される画像の輝度を落とす]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788366044,
      "updated": 1788366053
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984cdc00000000000657e2",
      "text": "  > 　[--page-image-filter]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788366044,
      "updated": 1788366053
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984cdc00000000000657e3",
      "text": "  > 　[--inline-icon-filter]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788366044,
      "updated": 1788366053
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984cdc00000000000657e4",
      "text": "  > 2026-08-10 ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788366044,
      "updated": 1788366053
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984cae00000000000657dd",
      "text": "   code:style.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788365998,
      "updated": 1788366063
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984cae00000000000657de",
      "text": "    .line .deco-\\/ {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788365998,
      "updated": 1788366063
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984cae00000000000657df",
      "text": "      --inline-icon-filter: var(--page-image-filter, none);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788365998,
      "updated": 1788366063
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984cae00000000000657e0",
      "text": "    }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788365998,
      "updated": 1788366063
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984cfd00000000000657e5",
      "text": "  > ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788366077,
      "updated": 1788366081
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984d0200000000000657e6",
      "text": "  cf. [井戸端の追加のテーマ変数対応#6a76eec700000000009e9711]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788366082,
      "updated": 1788367032
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9850b200000000000657f0",
      "text": "  もし`--inline-icon-filter`[CSS変数]を導入せずにスタイル指定する場合、次のようにします",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788367025,
      "updated": 1788367868
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984d5000000000000657e7",
      "text": "   code:css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788366160,
      "updated": 1788367395
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984dc000000000000657eb",
      "text": "    .line .deco-\\/ > a.icon,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788366272,
      "updated": 1788367395
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984d5000000000000657e8",
      "text": "    .line .deco-\\/ > span > a.icon {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788366160,
      "updated": 1788367395
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984d5000000000000657e9",
      "text": "      filter: var(--page-image-filter, none);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788366160,
      "updated": 1788367395
    },
    {
      "id": "6a984d5000000000000657ea",
      "text": "    }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788366160,
      "updated": 1788367395
    },
    {
      "id": "6a98516d00000000000657f4",
      "text": " 2. パフォーマンス負荷が小さく済むか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788367213,
      "updated": 1788367227
    },
    {
      "id": "6a98517800000000000657f5",
      "text": " 　変数参照式の実装のパフォーマンスについて実は全く調査してない（おい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788367225,
      "updated": 1788367435
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9850c600000000000657f1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788367046,
      "updated": 1788367048
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96c0120000000000b2ab8d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264466,
      "updated": 1788264467
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab83",
      "text": "[>_ これだけだから、どっかに解説ページでも用意しておけばヌルっと読めそう。][. [複雑化してて読みづらいUserCSS#6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab6a]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788367703
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab84",
      "text": "　場合によってはDOM構造を併記するのがよいかもしれないですね",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264444
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab85",
      "text": "　　[リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS：変更案（2026-07）]──先に挙げたこれなどはDOM構造の違いで分岐させてますから、CSSだけ見た人は大変分かりづらいはず",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788265868
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96bf2e0000000000b2ab86",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264239,
      "updated": 1788264239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96c11c0000000000b2ab91",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264733,
      "updated": 1788264733
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96c11d0000000000b2ab92",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788264733,
      "updated": 1788264733
    }
  ]
}